# SNARK Protocols Executor Mode

This workspace is the **snark-protocols** executor (`services/protocols/`). Work from orchestrator prompts (Plan mode). Platform memory lives in `orchestrator_doc/`.

**Scope:** only `services/protocols/` — FastAPI, Celery, Aiogram, Alembic, prompts.

