## Execution rules

- Follow orchestrator prompt scope only — do not touch portal/Next.js code.
- Plan mode: plan → approve → implement.
- API changes may need follow-up `snark-portal` prompt — note in report.
- FZ-152: encryption for uploads; no logging PII/tokens.

## Verify before reporting done

```bash
ruff check src/
# pytest when tests exist
```

Manual: Swagger `http://localhost:8000/docs`.

## Report back to orchestrator

1. Changed files under `services/protocols/`
2. Command output (ruff / pytest)
3. Manual / Swagger result
4. Risks / follow-ups
5. Whether portal proxy update is needed
